#: ../../chapters/appendix/additional_resources.rst:4
msgid "Additional Resources"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/additional_resources.rst:9
msgid ""
"Got questions? Need more information? Want to :ref:`contribute "
"<contributing>`? There are a variety of other resources where you can find "
"out more:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/additional_resources.rst:12
msgid ""
"**Mixxx Website**: For general information and updates, as well as the "
"latest news on Mixxx, go to: `<https://mixxx.org>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/additional_resources.rst:15
msgid ""
"**Mixxx Wiki**: For up-to-date information about supported DJ hardware, "
"documentation on making controller mappings, and other tips and tricks, go "
"to: `<https://github.com/mixxxdj/mixxx/wiki>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/additional_resources.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Keyboard Shortcuts**: This a list for all default Mixxx keyboard "
"shortcuts. Please note that these shortcuts are for keyboards configured in "
"English layout and default shortcuts may be different if your language "
"setting is not English. :ref:`default keyboard mappings<appendix-keyboard>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/additional_resources.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Mixxx Community Forums**: To search for answers, post your question or "
"answer other DJ's questions, go to: `<https://mixxx.org/forums>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/additional_resources.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Mixxx Zulip Chat**: Hang out with Mixxx developers and users on our `Zulip"
" chat <https://mixxx.zulipchat.com/>`_. Stand-alone `apps for Zulip "
"<https://zulipchat.com/apps/>`_ can be configured to use the server "
"``mixxx.zulipchat.com``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/additional_resources.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Mixxx Source Code**: To download the source code for Mixxx, go to: "
"`<https://github.com/mixxxdj/mixxx>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/additional_resources.rst:36
msgid ""
"**Mixxx Bug Tracker**: To report a bug or request a feature, go to: "
"`<https://github.com/mixxxdj/mixxx/issues>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/additional_resources.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Mixxx Translations**: To translate Mixxx and promote your mother tongue, "
"go to: `<https://explore.transifex.com/mixxx-dj-software/mixxxdj/>`_. Please"
" read the `Translation FAQ "
"<https://github.com/mixxxdj/mixxx/wiki/internationalization>`_ first."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapters/appendix/additional_resources.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Social Media**: Follow us on `Mastodon <https://floss.social/@mixxx>`_, "
"`Bluesky <https://bsky.app/profile/mixxx.bsky.social>`_, `Facebook "
"<https://www.facebook.com/mixxxdj/>`_ and `YouTube "
"<https://www.youtube.com/@mixxxdj/posts>`_"
msgstr ""
